    - target: {fileID: 7538284545847711421, guid: e4e90cd6ffce1f24d9826fee2e120b35, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Pipe System Explanation


        These tunnels connect to lots of
        smaller pipes under homes and buildings.

        All the dirty water flows
        together through the sewer system like a giant underground river!

'
